{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Four generations</b> — Here Isaac the fool erred, saying that each generation is thirty-five years, and behold from Adam to Noah are ten generations. Furthermore: Heman lived in the days of David, and David is the eleventh from Jacob our father, and Heman is twice that."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:45.109793666Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}